Subject: [PATCH 144/196] Add `IsExodusEnabled` (#231)

Checks whether the Exodus upgrade (at 2021-12-21T15:59:00Z) has activated yet, based on MTP.

Also replaces axionactivationtime with exodusactivationtime.
